## N51SUB listing photograph

`materials/N51SUB.jpg` was **not** published on the UTIG web site above.

It is a photograph taken by Yukio Yamamoto of a paper copy of the N51SUB assembly listing that he held from a past visit to UTIG. Included only to document ground-software structure (SEISDT / UNSCR / BOUT) used in deriving Path D.

